00:09:14.587 --> 00:09:16.607
Now, they don't block it.

00:09:16.607 --> 00:09:19.986
You know, they may make
it kind of inconvenient,

00:09:19.986 --> 00:09:23.050
and so, I would say,
there's a very fine line

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:26.963
