the layout of your site.

00:09:27.723 --> 00:09:30.240
Are you going to do four
pop-ups before they get to

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.414
what they want?

00:09:31.414 --> 00:09:33.515
You're going to lose them
by pop-up number two.

00:09:33.515 --> 00:09:36.232
There's a way to find
that perfect Mendoza line,

00:09:36.232 --> 00:09:38.460
between value for you and value for them.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:40.132
- I've never thought about
where they put the milk.

00:09:40.132 --> 00:09:40.759
- I know.

00:09:40.759 --> 00:09:42.152
- It's brilliant, it really is.

00:09:42.152 --> 00:09:43.255
- Thinking about the math--

00:09:43.255 --> 00:09:45.310
