the New York Rangers.

00:10:02.872 --> 00:10:04.476
Let's start with that.

00:10:04.476 --> 00:10:06.979
I would understand that
what Snapchat offers me

00:10:06.979 --> 00:10:09.912
right now, at this recording, early 2016,

00:10:09.912 --> 00:10:12.476
